  m_text: 'How hard the sticks drive and turn. At 100% turn sensitivity a spin from
    standstill uses both sides at full speed, like the real robot: lower it for a
    calmer spin, raise it and the stick answers sooner. Every robot ramps its controls
    instead of snapping to full. Changes apply the next time you press Drive.'
